{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sluggish is a punishing, charming and simple platformer where you guide a bouncy, slippery slug spirit through the whimsical underworld of Sorborn. Ascend a seamless vertical world across six distinct biomes, dodging obstacles and enemies in a silhouetted art style. With permadeath, checkpoints, and limited hearts, your goal is to reach the Well of Souls to find eternal rest. One wrong move, and you\u2019re back to the start. Can you conquer the climb?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746990?t=1749349205","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746990?t=1749349205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746990/a9b6008b7a38da3d15ffdbfa7b32c235550c88bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749349205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746990/a9b6008b7a38da3d15ffdbfa7b32c235550c88bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749349205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game is set in a stylized underworld with themes of death, featuring skulls, ghostly figures, aggressive red highlighted enemies and a dark, moody atmosphere. It includes creepy and unsettling elements, such as eerie environments and spooky sounds.\u201d"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sluggish is a punishing, charming and simple platformer where you guide a bouncy, slippery slug spirit through the whimsical underworld of Sorborn. Ascend a seamless vertical world across s